{"3304320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CFS (Chinese Football Simulator)", "steam_appid": 3304320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4012700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/6b39a43dcf6e646d16aa983e1a4d268c.avif?t=1775529040\" width=1080 height=2658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear International Players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Gookoo Games, the solo developer of this indie football title. As this is a one-person project, please kindly wait for localized versions. I promise to prioritize multilingual support as development progresses. Thank you for your interest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >————————————————————————————————————</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Foreword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other Chinese football games filled with self-deprecating jokes, repetitive memes, or excessive focus on negative stereotypes, this game carries a different vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe in Chinese football's brighter future. We're no football desert. Even if we're not at our best today, we deserve dreams - to find our path forward with courage and determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chinese Football Simulator</i> delivers an authentic local football management experience with Chinese characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond standard 3D match simulations, team management, and youth academy development, you'll:<br>• Tour across China's football landscape<br>• Forge mutually beneficial relationships<br>• Scout hidden gems from grassroots/amateur circuits<br>• Customize every aspect through MOD Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May you thrive in China's vibrant football world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome, Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• As both club owner and manager, choose your background and operate your team freely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customize: Tactics • Kits • Badges • Stadiums • Facilities • Stand decorations • and more</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/bd2acd3974cda3a2edca92d87b297f26.poster.avif?t=1775529040\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/bd2acd3974cda3a2edca92d87b297f26.webm?t=1775529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/bd2acd3974cda3a2edca92d87b297f26.mp4?t=1775529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Football Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit major cities, establish affiliate clubs, and build your network through reciprocal relationships with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/751344fc15330cd02c9b5bb23d0910f6.poster.avif?t=1775529040\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/751344fc15330cd02c9b5bb23d0910f6.webm?t=1775529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304320/extras/751344fc15330cd02c9b5bb23d0910f6.mp4?t=1775529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"